.TH NEXUS-CENTER 1 "November 2026" "nexusos-command-center 0.2.0" "NexusOS Engineering Edition"
.SH NAME
nexus-center \- Nexus Command Center, native NexusOS system management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nexus-center
[\fB\-\-page\fR \fIMODULE\fR] [\fB\-\-smoke\fR [\fB\-\-screenshots\fR \fIDIR\fR]] [\fB\-\-benchmark\fR \fISECONDS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Qt 6/QML application for software (APT), settings, terminal and SSH, containers,
Nexus applications, the NGINX gateway, storage, network, files, local AI,
notifications, security and activity history. It runs as the logged-in user;
privileged operations are performed by nexusos-management-agent after polkit
authorization. Press Ctrl+K for the command palette.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-page \fIMODULE\fR
Open a module first (overview, packages, settings, terminal, containers,
applications, gateway, storage, network, files, ai, notifications, security, activity).
.TP
.B \-\-smoke
Open every module once, print timings and QML warnings as JSON, exit (non-zero on warnings).
.TP
.B \-\-benchmark \fISECONDS\fR
Like \-\-smoke, then measure idle CPU and memory for SECONDS.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B NEXUS_CENTER_PLATFORMTHEME
Qt platform theme to use. Default \fBgeneric\fR (lighter; Qt Quick file dialogs).
\fBkde\fR gives native KDE file dialogs at about 90 MiB more memory;
\fBdesktop\fR keeps the session's \fBQT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME\fR.
.TP
.B NEXUS_CENTER_DEBUG
Print Qt and QML messages to standard error.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.local/share/nexusos/command-center.db
(settings, SSH profiles, notifications, activity; mode 0600)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nexus (1)
.SH AUTHOR
NexusOS was crafted by Sanjay, with the NexusOS contributors.
